    {
      "cue_id": "c020_jiang_qinghuang_p052",
      "act_id": "act3_frost_coffin_ice_carving_origin_womb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "jiang_qinghuang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[coldly] [dramatically] 绝非顾长渊一人所为！本帝想起来了，太上仙朝覆灭前曾有一桩最高绝密，仙庭叛逆者与某位禁忌存在曾在归墟源海培育过一具唯一能硬破五阶基因锁而不爆体的【第零号无漏原胎】！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.0,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "mental_realm",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
      "loop": false,
      "placement": "sequential",
      "gain_db": 0.0,
      "gap_after_s": 0.32,
      "director_note": "姜清凰道出太上仙朝覆灭前归墟源海第零号无漏原胎绝密"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "c021_jiang_qinghuang_p053",
      "act_id": "act3_frost_coffin_ice_carving_origin_womb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "jiang_qinghuang",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "[calmly] [dramatically] 顾长渊当年自碎元神抢占轮回时，必定发现这具原胎早已被各方恐怖老怪提前埋下了钉子！他来不及清理，只能用【方寸墟界】的灰印强行压住眉心，赌现世诞生的你能在他们彻底苏醒前杀出一条活路！",
      "tts_text": "",
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.85,
      "acoustic_space": "mental_realm",
      "motif_id": "",
      "sfx_prompt": "",
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "prompt_influence": 0.55,
