      "act_id": "act3_frost_coffin_ice_carving_origin_womb",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "role_id": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "",
      "text": "冰壁上，姜清凰的剑痕透出一股肃杀寒气：",
